      "english": "See, Viper? THAT'S a samurai!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0007D060",
      "source_words_sha256": "3c8cfebc74aa1c642335ba5efb6b21f8f7de41a6a2906ce3a9d41b68a976620c",
      "english": "Don't get cocky!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0007D09C",
      "source_words_sha256": "46d500feaa721ab5cba025a2adb770635a221e4330c644a0f69537174f9e0174",
      "english": "Sougo. Left my protractor at home. Gonna pop back for it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
